      "writtenOn": "2022-11-29T19:40:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve added you to the e-mail thread for the context. The idea is that we want to have a simple way from android framework to switch from default behavior (decode SDR only part of JPEGR) to decode HDR. There were multiple ways discussed to address it, but we ended up on the way that client will indicate that it wants to get HDR image by setting RGB1010102 color as desination color. In this case framework will call newly introduced method - setHDRDecodeMode(true) and JpegCodec will switch to delivering HDR. The HDR Decode path currently has limitations: no scaling and only RGB1010102 is supported as output color format. This change implements this.\nPlease let me know if we want to set up a meeting over GVC so I could explain more and address your concerns.",
      "parentUuid": "b3d48de9_fa4166fc",
      "revId": "5ea6e997e3110e2ab1d86f496821c4e3e71544f8",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
